    "name": "Destroy! Mosaic!",
    "steam_appid": 3436370,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Story</h2><br>In a world where many races live together peacefully. One day, a crack appeared in the sky, and with a loud bang, the crack turned into a large black hole, from which many magical particles shot out and hit people. The clothes of those who got hit changed and became like a mosaic. To save them, a young witch and her familiar appeared.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/650ad6d2db8261e0dbf3b8df2e226d1a.poster.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/650ad6d2db8261e0dbf3b8df2e226d1a.webm?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/650ad6d2db8261e0dbf3b8df2e226d1a.mp4?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Gameplay</h2><br>Hit the energy balls to destroy the mosaic! Use your mouse to play, move your wand left and right to control it, right click to charge magic power and left click to fire thunder magic when you've charged up your magic power!<br>Clear all the mosaics! Be careful not to miss the energy ball and hurt yourself!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/28ca9637066ce79324bce1a036b16293.poster.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/28ca9637066ce79324bce1a036b16293.webm?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/28ca9637066ce79324bce1a036b16293.mp4?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Items</h2><br>Sometimes breaking mosaic tiles will drop magic items, collect those useful tools to destroy the mosaic! But be careful! Some magic items may have negative effects.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/595eb13486e57254aa4a8e5d38617c10.poster.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/595eb13486e57254aa4a8e5d38617c10.webm?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/595eb13486e57254aa4a8e5d38617c10.mp4?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Skill Enhancement System</h2><br>On your adventure to destroy the mosaic, the protagonist will grow stronger. Use these skill points to become proficient in various magic elements!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/406882721d96f5590d0471dc431ab39c.poster.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/406882721d96f5590d0471dc431ab39c.webm?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/406882721d96f5590d0471dc431ab39c.mp4?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Lots of Characters</h2><br>There are cute adventurers all over the world who need the protagonist to save them. Come and strip... I mean, eliminate the mosaic on those 10 poor adventurers!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/cd40aa4003122b7267fc588a1b5fd34f.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Black Shadow mode</h2><br>Stripping naked isn\u2019t enough? The naked adventurers are now attacked by monsters and got cursed with mosaic AGAIN!! The mosaic must be cleansed!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/05d03fe62da14e7064e33bf49e162e02.poster.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/05d03fe62da14e7064e33bf49e162e02.webm?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/05d03fe62da14e7064e33bf49e162e02.mp4?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Boss levels</h2><br>Unanimated CGs feels a bit lackluster? Aside from regular levels, there are also boss levels with animated CGs! Not only that the CGs are animated, you also get to earn more skill points!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/f31652cd0d46a3651d6e5486d357f6b7.poster.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/f31652cd0d46a3651d6e5486d357f6b7.webm?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/f31652cd0d46a3651d6e5486d357f6b7.mp4?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Gallery</h2><br>&quot;There are various features in the gallery to help you better \u201cenjoy\u201d the CGs! In addition to the level content, the more heart points you have left when clearing a level, the more CGs you'll unlock! With over 80 CGs, 5 animated CGs, and many more variants, there's plenty for you to enjoy!&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/31875891623f2b961155cf4a5948c162.poster.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/31875891623f2b961155cf4a5948c162.webm?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/31875891623f2b961155cf4a5948c162.mp4?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Story</h2><br>In a world where many races live together peacefully. One day, a crack appeared in the sky, and with a loud bang, the crack turned into a large black hole, from which many magical particles shot out and hit people. The clothes of those who got hit changed and became like a mosaic. To save them, a young witch and her familiar appeared.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/650ad6d2db8261e0dbf3b8df2e226d1a.poster.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/650ad6d2db8261e0dbf3b8df2e226d1a.webm?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/650ad6d2db8261e0dbf3b8df2e226d1a.mp4?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Gameplay</h2><br>Hit the energy balls to destroy the mosaic! Use your mouse to play, move your wand left and right to control it, right click to charge magic power and left click to fire thunder magic when you've charged up your magic power!<br>Clear all the mosaics! Be careful not to miss the energy ball and hurt yourself!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/28ca9637066ce79324bce1a036b16293.poster.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/28ca9637066ce79324bce1a036b16293.webm?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/28ca9637066ce79324bce1a036b16293.mp4?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Items</h2><br>Sometimes breaking mosaic tiles will drop magic items, collect those useful tools to destroy the mosaic! But be careful! Some magic items may have negative effects.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/595eb13486e57254aa4a8e5d38617c10.poster.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/595eb13486e57254aa4a8e5d38617c10.webm?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/595eb13486e57254aa4a8e5d38617c10.mp4?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Skill Enhancement System</h2><br>On your adventure to destroy the mosaic, the protagonist will grow stronger. Use these skill points to become proficient in various magic elements!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/406882721d96f5590d0471dc431ab39c.poster.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/406882721d96f5590d0471dc431ab39c.webm?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/406882721d96f5590d0471dc431ab39c.mp4?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Lots of Characters</h2><br>There are cute adventurers all over the world who need the protagonist to save them. Come and strip... I mean, eliminate the mosaic on those 10 poor adventurers!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/cd40aa4003122b7267fc588a1b5fd34f.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Black Shadow mode</h2><br>Stripping naked isn\u2019t enough? The naked adventurers are now attacked by monsters and got cursed with mosaic AGAIN!! The mosaic must be cleansed!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/05d03fe62da14e7064e33bf49e162e02.poster.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/05d03fe62da14e7064e33bf49e162e02.webm?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/05d03fe62da14e7064e33bf49e162e02.mp4?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Boss levels</h2><br>Unanimated CGs feels a bit lackluster? Aside from regular levels, there are also boss levels with animated CGs! Not only that the CGs are animated, you also get to earn more skill points!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/f31652cd0d46a3651d6e5486d357f6b7.poster.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/f31652cd0d46a3651d6e5486d357f6b7.webm?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/f31652cd0d46a3651d6e5486d357f6b7.mp4?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Gallery</h2><br>&quot;There are various features in the gallery to help you better \u201cenjoy\u201d the CGs! In addition to the level content, the more heart points you have left when clearing a level, the more CGs you'll unlock! With over 80 CGs, 5 animated CGs, and many more variants, there's plenty for you to enjoy!&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/31875891623f2b961155cf4a5948c162.poster.avif?t=1752637302\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/31875891623f2b961155cf4a5948c162.webm?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436370/extras/31875891623f2b961155cf4a5948c162.mp4?t=1752637302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
